        Index to TRMM Near-Real-Time Examples and Documentation

                            George J. Huffman
                            13 February 2009


Introduction

The FTP site ftp://meso.gsfc.nasa.gov/pub/trmmdocs/rt contains 
a variety of detailed documentation and programming examples for the 
Near-Real-Time TRMM Multi-Satellite Precipitation Analysis (TMPA-RT) 
data sets, which are available on the anonymous FTP site 
ftp://trmmopen.gsfc.nasa.gov/pub/merged/ .  This index is a brief 
guide to the documentation.  Routinely updated examples and archived 
cases are posted to the TRMM 
web site at http://trmm.gsfc.nasa.gov .


